    "user_request_original": "Perform one bounded TMM thickness optimization for an exactly 20-layer planar stack. Use the fixed material sequence from the incident side: HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica / HfO2 / Fused Silica. Optimize only the physical thickness of each finite layer within the user-declared bounds. Do not optimize material identity or layer count in this route. Optimize a 20-layer alternating dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Material sequence: SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2. Layer 10 (SiO2 cavity) must be initialized at 250.0 nm with hard bounds [238.0, 262.0] nm. Layers 0-9 and 11-19 are free optimization variables with bounds [50.0, 450.0] nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer. Target: maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band, maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
    "normalized_request_english": "Perform bounded TMM thickness optimization of a 20-layer alternating SiO2/HfO2 stack on fused silica under air incidence. Optimize layer thicknesses within [50, 450] nm, with layer 10 constrained to [238, 262] nm and initialized at 250 nm. Maximize mean transmittance from 1000 to 1700 nm and mean reflectance from 300 to 450 nm at normal incidence, unpolarized illumination. Suppress unwanted reflection in the NIR band and transmission in the visible band.",
